:: Prison Canteen
<<set $bus to "canteen">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<effects_prison>>

당신은 식당에 있다. 넓은 방 안은 식탁들이 줄지어 채우고 있다. 천장이 너무 낮아 키가 큰 수감자들은 똑바로 설 수 없으며, 길이와 너비에 비해 답답한 느낌을 준다.
<<if $prison.schedule is "wake" or $prison.schedule is "lunch" or $prison.schedule is "dinner">>
	Inmates queue for their grub, shoulder to shoulder and close enough for every mutter to carry. <<generate_methodical_guard 0>><<methodical_guard 0 cap>> stands in the corner, flipping through the pages of a book.
<<elseif $prison.schedule is "work">>
	You hear clattering from the kitchen. Someone barks an order, followed by the scrape of a heavy pot over tile.
<<else>>
	It's currently empty. The tables look worse without the crowd to hide the stains.
<</if>>
<<endevent>>
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour is 20>>
종소리가 울린다. "통제 시간이다." <<generate_methodical_guard 0>><<methodical_guard 0>>【이가】 외친다. "다들 감옥으로 돌아가."
	<br><br>
	You're shuffled along with the other prisoners. No one wants to be the last one moving.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|Prison Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passout_prison>>
<<else>>

	<<if $prison.schedule isnot "lockdown" and $prison.attention gte 100>>
		<<events_prison_attention>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $prison.schedule isnot "lockdown" and $eventskip isnot 1>>
			<<events_prison>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $prison_event_trigger>>
			<<events_prison_triggered>>
		<<else>>
			<<if random(1, 5) is 5 and $eventskip isnot 1 and ($prison.schedule is "wake" or $prison.schedule is "lunch" or $prison.schedule is "dinner")>>
				<<prison_guard_watch methodical>>
			<<else>>
				<<if $prison.schedule is "wake">>
					<<foodicon "eat">><<link [[아침 식사 (최대 1시간)|Prison Breakfast]]>><<pass 1>><<advancetohour>><<stress -6>><</link>><<lstress>>
					<br><br>
				<<elseif $prison.schedule is "lunch">>
					<<foodicon "eat">><<link [[점심 식사 (최대 1시간)|Prison Lunch]]>><<pass 1>><<advancetohour>><<stress -6>><</link>><<lstress>>
					<br><br>
				<<elseif $prison.schedule is "dinner">>
					<<foodicon "eat">><<link [[저녁 식사 (최대 1시간)|Prison Dinner]]>><<pass 1>><<advancetohour>><<stress -6>><</link>><<lstress>>
					<br><br>
				<</if>>
				<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Prison Yard]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<prison_map canteen>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $eventskip to 0>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Prison Breakfast
<<effects>>

<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	You queue with the other prisoners. The line moves in shoves and mutters. The <<person>> behind the counter fills a bowl full of sloppy porridge, and rests it on your head.
	<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	빨대가 포함되어 있어, 재갈 너머로 간신히 밀어 넣을 수 있을지도 모른다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
		<span class="blue">재갈만 아니었다면 도움을 요청할 수 있었을 것이다.</span>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[누군가에게 도움을 요청한다|Prison Breakfast Help]]>><<prison_inmates -1>><</link>><<lrespect>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[조심스럽게 자리를 찾는다|Prison Breakfast Careful]]>><</link>><<dancedifficulty 1 600>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<wearProp "lunch tray">>
	You queue with the other prisoners, and receive a bowl full of sloppy porridge. It smells burnt at the bottom and watery everywhere else.
	<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
		빨대가 포함되어 있어, 재갈 너머로 간신히 밀어 넣을 수 있을지도 모른다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You look for a free seat, tray held close while elbows and shoulders knock around you.
	<<if $prison.protection is "scarred">>
		<<generate_scarred_inmate 0>><<scarred_inmate 0 cap>><<person1>> asks you to sit on <<his>> lap. <<His>> gang make room before you answer.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[무릎에 앉는다|Prison Breakfast Scarred]]>><<prison_rep scarred 1>><<prison_attention 1>><</link>><<gperlove>><<gattention prison>>
		<br>
		<<link [[거절한다|Prison Breakfast Scarred Refuse]]>><<prison_inmates 1>><</link>><<grespect>>
	<<else>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Prison Breakfast Help
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"C-Could someone help me?" you ask. "Please?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Could someone help me, please?" you ask, trying to sound civil over the din.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Could someone help me?" you ask, keeping your eyes low. "Please?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"누가 손 좀 빌려줘." 당신이 말한다.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		You let the impatience show before anyone gets the chance to laugh.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	"누가 좀 도와줄 수 있을까." 당신이 말한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

A <<person>> takes the bowl from your head. "Sure, darling." <<He>> smacks your <<bottom>>. "Get moving."
<br><br>

다른 죄수들이 지켜보는 가운데 <<He>>【이가】 손으로 당신에게 먹여준다. 그들은 재미있어하는 것 같다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Careful
<<effects>>

<<if $danceSuccess>>
	You walk to a free seat. A couple of inmates stick out their legs, <span class="green">but you spot the trick and step over them without losing balance.</span> A few disappointed groans follow you to the bench.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You walk towards a free seat. An inmate sticks out a leg, <span class="red">tripping you.</span> Your bowl clatters against the ground, spilling food everywhere. Laughter ripples down the table before you can even move.
	<br><br>

	<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
		<<generate_veteran_guard 0>><<person1>>
		장화 소리가 들린다. 당신이 일어서기도 전에, <<veteran_guard 0>>【이가】 당신의 등에 발을 올린다. "우리의 깨끗한 바닥을 더럽혀?" <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "용납 못 해."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Lick Refuse]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<generate_veteran_guard 0>><<person1>>
		장화 소리가 들린다. 당신이 일어서기도 전에, <<veteran_guard 0>>【이가】 당신의 등에 발을 올린다. "우리의 깨끗한 바닥을 더럽혀?" <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "용납 못 해. 핥아. 전부 다."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[핥는다|Prison Breakfast Lick]]>><<prison_inmates -3>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<llrespect>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
		<<link [[거절한다|Prison Breakfast Lick Refuse]]>><<prison_inmates 3>><<pain 8>><<trauma 12>><<stress 12>><<prison_guards -1>><</link>><<ggpain>><<ggtrauma>><<ggstress>><<gsuspicion>><<ggrespect>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Prison Breakfast Lick
<<effects>>

다른 죄수들이 지켜보는 것이 느껴진다. <<veteran_guard 0 cap>>【은는】 당신이 쏟아진 것을 전부 핥을 때까지 <<his>> 장화를 치우지 않는다. "좋아." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "이제 앉아."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Lick Refuse
<<effects>>

<<generate_methodical_guard 1>>

<<veteran_guard 0 cap>> removes <<his>> boot, only to smack you back against the ground with <<his>> baton. You curl up as best you can with your arms bound, as <<he>> delivers blow after blow. The canteen quiets, but no one comes to help.<<if $phase is 1>><<prison_inmates 3>><<pain 8>><<trauma 12>><<stress 12>><<prison_guards -1>><<ggpain>><<ggtrauma>><<ggstress>><<gsuspicion>><<ggrespect>><</if>>
<br><br>

"그만하면 됐어." <<methodical_guard 1>>【이가】 끼어든다. "이것 때문에 기도를 늦출 순 없어."
<br><br>

<<veteran_guard 0 cap>> backs away from you. <<tearful>> you rise to your feet, and find a seat. The nearest inmates look away once you're upright.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Scarred
<<effects>>

You sit on <<scarred_inmate 0 apo>> lap. <<His>> arm settles around you before the tray is steady.
<<if $prison.scarred gte 80>>
	<<He>>【이가】 당신의 그릇과 숟가락을 가져가 <<himself>> 먹여준다. <<his>> 패거리가 이를 이상하게 생각하더라도, 아무런 내색도 하지 않는다.
<<elseif $prison.scarred gte 20>>
	<<He>>【이가】 당신의 그릇을 가져가, 당신이 먹는 동안 들고 있어 준다.
<<else>>
	<<wearProp "soup bowl">>
	You're too high, and far, from the table to use it. You rest the bowl on your own thigh while eating, trying not to spill any on <<him>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
	당신은 가끔 꼬집히는 것을 견뎌낸다.<<gstress>><<gpain>><<stress 6>><<pain 4>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Scarred Refuse
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"N-No, thank you," you say, slipping away from <<scarred_inmate 0>> before your nerve fails.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"No, thank you," you say to <<scarred_inmate 0>>, making the refusal as neat as you can in a prison canteen.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You give <<scarred_inmate 0>> a small shake of your head, then sit elsewhere before anyone can steer you back.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Find another cushion," you say to <<scarred_inmate 0>>, and sit elsewhere.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		You don't look back to see if the words landed.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	"No," you say to <<scarred_inmate 0>>, and sit elsewhere.
<</if>>
<<if $prison.scarred gte 80>>
	<<He>>【은는】 상처받은 표정이다.
<<else>>
	<<he>>【이가】 으르렁거리는 소리가 들린다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Prayer
<<effects>>

<<generate_methodical_guard 0>><<methodical_guard 0 cap>><<person1>> clears <<his>> throat, still holding the book in <<his>> hands and seemingly settled on a passage. "Bow your heads," <<he>> says. "In prayer." Most of the inmates have already bowed. Trays still scrape and someone coughs, but the room lowers its voice for <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<link [[고개를 숙인다|Prison Breakfast Prayer Bow]]>><<sub 1>><<purity 2>><</link>><<gpurity>>
<br>
<<link [[Bow your head and daydream|Prison Breakfast Prayer Daydream]]>><<stress -3>><<tiredness -1.5>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Prison Breakfast Prayer Refuse]]>><<def 1>><<prison_inmates 1>><<suspicion 1>><</link>><<gsuspicion>><<grespect>>
<br>
<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("angel") gte 6) and !$worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	<<link [[설교를 하겠다고 제안한다|Prison Breakfast Prayer Angel]]>><<prison_hope 1>><</link>><<angel>><<ghope>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("fallen") gte 2) and !$worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	<<link [[설교를 하겠다고 제안한다|Prison Breakfast Prayer Fallen]]>><<prison_reb 3>><<prison_hope -1>><</link>><<fallenangel>><<lhope>><<ggreb>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("demon") gte 6) and !$worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	<<link [[설교를 하겠다고 제안한다|Prison Breakfast Prayer Demon]]>><<prison_reb 1>><</link>><<demon>><<greb>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Prison Breakfast Prayer Angel
<<effects>>

당신은 일어나 <<methodical_guard 0>>에게 걸어간다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 무례함에 화가 난 듯 보이지만, 당신의 눈빛에서 무언가를 보고 <<him>>의 태도가 부드러워진다.

<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
	팔이 묶여 있어 기도서를 들 수는 없지만, 그럴 필요는 없다. 당신은 기억에 의존해 설교를 읊는다.
<<else>>
	<<He>>【이가】 기도서를 내밀지만, 당신은 그럴 필요가 없다. 당신은 가슴에 손을 얹고 기억에 의존해 설교를 읊는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

The prisoners listen in rapt attention. You think some are hiding tears beneath their bowed heads. Even the worst tables fall still.
<<methodical_guard 0 cap>>【은는】 멍한 표정을 짓다가, 일정이 떠오르자 정신을 차린다. "일어나." <<He>>【이가】 깊은 숨을 내쉰다. "모두 밖으로."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Prayer Fallen
<<effects>>

당신은 일어나 <<methodical_guard 0>>에게 걸어간다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 무례함에 화가 난 듯 보이지만, 당신의 눈빛에서 무언가를 보고 <<him>>【이가】 겁을 먹는다.
<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
	팔이 묶여 있어 기도서를 들 수는 없지만, 그럴 필요는 없다. 당신은 기억에 의존해 설교를 읊는다.
<<else>>
	<<He>>【이가】 기도서를 내밀지만, 당신은 그럴 필요가 없다. 당신은 가슴에 손을 얹고 기억에 의존해 설교를 읊는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

This is not a sermon they would give at the temple. Not in public. But it's fitting here. You speak of emptiness and loss. Damnation and despair. A cloud descends over the room, and even <<methodical_guard 0>> is affected. "Stop," <<he>> says at last. "Rise. Everyone outside."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Prayer Demon
<<effects>>

당신은 일어나 <<methodical_guard 0>>에게 걸어간다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 무례함에 화가 난 듯 보이지만, 당신의 눈빛에서 무언가를 보고 <<him>>【이가】 매혹된다.

<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
	팔이 묶여 있어 기도서를 들 수는 없지만, 그럴 필요는 없다. 당신은 기억에 의존해 설교를 읊는다.
<<else>>
	<<He>>【이가】 기도서를 내밀지만, 당신은 그럴 필요가 없다. 당신은 가슴에 손을 얹고 기억에 의존해 설교를 읊는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

당신은 여기저기 세부 사항을 바꾸고, 암시와 신성모독을 슬쩍 끼워 넣는다. 좀 더 학식 있는 죄수 몇몇이 웃음을 참는다. <<methodical_guard 0 cap>>【은는】 범인을 찾으려 방을 훑어본다. "그만하면 됐어." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "일어나. 모두 밖으로."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Prayer Bow
<<effects>>

당신은 고개를 숙인다. <<methodical_guard 0 cap>>【은는】 처벌에 대한 기도문을 읊고는 책을 탁 덮는다. "일어나. 모두 밖으로."
<br><br>

당신은 다른 죄수들과 함께 밖으로 나간다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Prayer Daydream
<<effects>>

당신은 고개를 숙이지만, <<methodical_guard 0 apo>> 말에는 주의를 기울이지 않는다.

<<if random(1,3) is 3>>
	<<if isLoveInterest("Robin")>>
		당신은 로빈을 생각한다. 당신 없이 <<nnpc_he "Robin">>【이가】 잘 지내고 있기를 바란다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Whitney")>>
		당신은 휘트니를 생각한다. <<nnpc_he Whitney>>【이가】 인정하든 안 하든, <<nnpc_he Whitney>>【이가】 당신을 그리워할 거라고 확신한다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Eden")>>
		당신은 에덴을 생각한다. <<nnpc_he Eden>>【이가】 너무 걱정하지 않기를 바란다. <<nnpc_he Eden>>조차도 여기까지 올 수는 없을 거라고 생각한다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Kylar") and C.npc.Kylar.state is "prison">>
		당신은 카일라를 생각한다. <<nnpc_he "Kylar">>【이가】 탈출할 수 있을지 궁금하지만, 그럴 수 없을 거라고 생각한다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Avery")>>
		당신은 에이버리를 생각하며 <<nnpc_he Avery>>【이가】 당신의 자유를 사줄 수 있을지 궁금해한다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Sydney")>>
		당신은 시드니를 생각한다. 당신도 <<nnpc_his Sydney>> 생각 속에 있다는 것을 안다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Alex")>>
		당신은 알렉스를 생각하며 농장이 어떻게 지내는지 궁금해한다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Black Wolf")>>
		당신은 검은 늑대와 무리를 생각한다. 그들이 배고프지 않기를 바란다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Great Hawk")>>
		당신은 거대 매를 생각한다. <<nnpc_He "Great Hawk">>【이가】 당신을 찾고 있을 테지만, <<nnpc_he "Great Hawk">>【이가】 이렇게 멀리까지 찾을지는 의심스럽다.
	<<elseif isLoveInterest("Bailey")>>
		You think about Bailey. You had never seen <<nnpc_him "Bailey">> as out of control as <<nnpc_he "Bailey">> looked when you were being sent here. You hope to return to <<nnpc_him "Bailey">> soon.
	<<else>>
		당신은 마을을 생각하며 얼마나 많은 것을 당연하게 여겼는지 깨닫는다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $rng gte 81>>
		고아들이 괜찮기를 바란다.
	<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
		당신은 학교를 생각하며 당신의 결석이 무단결석으로 처리되지 않기를 바란다.
	<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
		당신의 생각은 온갖 곳을 떠돈다.
	<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
		다른 죄수들 중 얼마나 많은 이들이 주의를 기울이고 있는지 궁금하다.
	<<else>>
		You hear <<his>> voice, though. It seems to echo, but there's something wrong with it, like another voice is layered atop <<hers>>.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>>【이가】 책을 탁 덮는다. "일어나. 모두 밖으로."
<br><br>

You shuffle outside with the other inmates. Your thoughts return to the prison by the time you reach the door.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Breakfast Prayer Refuse
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You keep your head raised, though your hands tense in your lap.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You keep your head raised. It feels rude, somehow, which makes the silence worse.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You look down at first, then force your head up again.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You stare at <<methodical_guard 0>>, refusing to bow.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		Let them try, if they want.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You stare at <<methodical_guard 0>>.
<</if>>
<<if $prison.shock is 1>>
	<<if $prison.guards gte 40>>
		당신은 <<methodical_guard 0>>【을를】 쳐다본다. "죄수 144번." <<he>>【이가】 쏘아붙인다. "<span class="green">한 번 더 기회를 주지.</span> 당장 머리를 숙여."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[머리를 숙인다|Prison Breakfast Prayer Bow]]>><<sub 1>><<purity 2>><</link>><<gpurity>>
		<br>
		<<link [[다시 거부한다|Prison Breakfast Prayer Refuse 2]]>><<prison_inmates 1>><<prison_guards -1>><</link>><<gsuspicion>><<grespect>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		당신은 <<methodical_guard 0>>【을를】 쳐다본다. <<He>>【이가】 <<his>> 셔츠 주머니에 손을 넣는다. <span class="red">끔찍한 충격이 당신의 몸을 관통한다.</span> 당신의 목에서부터 시작된 충격이다. 잠시뿐이었지만, 땅에 쓰러져 경련을 일으키기엔 충분했다.<<gtrauma>><<ggstress>><<gggpain>><<trauma 4>><<stress 4>><<pain 4>>
		<br><br>
		당신은 너무 다쳐서 <<methodical_guard 0>>【이가】 수갑을 채우고 식당에서 끌어내는 것에 저항할 수 없다. 다른 죄수들은 당신이 지나갈 때 놀리지만, 악의가 있는 것 같지는 않다.
		<<bind>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[다음|Prison Punishment]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	당신은 <<methodical_guard 0>>【을를】 쳐다본다. <<He>>【이가】 <<his>> 셔츠 주머니에 손을 넣다가, <span class="green">망설인다.</span> <<He>>【은는】 당신을 언급하지 않고 말을 시작한다.
	<br><br>
	<<He>>【은는】 징벌에 대한 긴 목록을 읊은 후, 책을 탁 소리 나게 덮는다. "일어서. 모두 밖으로."
	<br><br>

	당신은 다른 죄수들과 함께 밖으로 나간다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Prison Yard]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

