:: Prison Lunch Tattooed Refuse
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"P-Please don't," you say, shaking off <<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> hand.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'd rather sit alone," you say, shaking off <<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> hand.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You draw your arm back from <<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> grip and look for somewhere else to sit.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Get off," you say, shaking off <<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> hand.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		You don't bother lowering your voice.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	당신은 <<tattooed_inmate 0 apo>> 손을 뿌리친다.
<</if>>
<<if $prison.tattooed gte 80>>
	"내가 뭘 어쨌다고?" <<he>>【이가】 묻는다. "좋아. 어떤 새끼가 널 강간하지 않게 조심해."
<<else>>
	<<He>>【이가】 당신을 다시 잡지만, <<him>> 옆에 있던 <<generate2>><<person2>><<person>>【이가】 이번에는 <<his>> 팔을 잡고 경비원을 힐끗 본다. <<tattooed_inmate 0 cap>>【은는】 당신을 놓아주고, 쏘아보며 자리를 뜬다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

당신은 앉을 자리를 찾아 수프를 먹는다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

