:: Prison Dinner Kylar
<<effects>>

당신이 자리에 앉자, 카일라가 옆에 앉는다. <<him>>의 반대편에 있던 죄수는 당신에게 불쾌한 시선을 던지며 자리를 옮긴다.
<br><br>

카일라는 당신이 먹기 전에 당신의 음식을 맛보겠다고 고집한다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Dinner Kylar Refuse
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You take a seat in a crowded spot, hoping Kylar will understand without you having to say much.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You tell Kylar you need space, then take a seat in a crowded spot before <<he>> can argue.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You take a seat in a crowded spot and keep your attention on your tray.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You take a seat in the most crowded spot you can find.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		You don't leave Kylar any room to pretend it was an accident.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You take a seat in a crowded spot.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Kylar tries to squeeze in beside you, but the adjacent inmate shoves <<him>> away. Kylar falls, and <<his>> tray scatters across the ground.
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 방에서 뛰쳐나가며 <<his>> 얼굴을 가린다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Breakfast Prayer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
