:: Prison Dinner Move
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You decide to find another seat before the <<person>> gets louder.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Fine," you say, taking your tray. "Enjoy it."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You gather your tray and move without looking at the <<person>> again.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You stand with your tray. "Wasn't worth keeping anyway," you say.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		You let your eyes linger on the mess <<he>> calls dinner.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You decide to find another seat.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The inmates were hoping for drama, but that's not your concern.
<br><br>

